  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Response in Timor-Leste</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this investment DFAT supports Humanitarian response in Timor-Leste.  DFAT works with the Government of Timor-Leste and other partners.
This investment covers AUD4 million in emergency relief provided as part of Australia&#x2019;s support to the 2021 floods and COVID-19 surge in Timor-Leste. Activities include: humanitarian emergency supplies and purchase of replacement medical supplies, including PPE for the Australian Red Cross to work with the Timorese Red Cross and other local partners to provide support for communities on the ground; deployment of an AUSMAT team to conduct a public health assessment for COVID 19 management; and support to Australian Humanitarian Partnership to support the flood response in the context of managing COVID 19.</narrative>
  </description>
